**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.next
**/.next/**
coverage
coverage/**
test-results
test-results/**
playwright-report
playwright-report/**
services/*/api
*.tar.gz
*:Zone.Identifier
